\item Data cleaning
\item Feature engineering
\item Modeling
\end{itemize}

\section{Architecture}
\noindent We utilize a Feedforward Neural Network (FFNN) architecture.
\begin{itemize}
\item Input layer: Time-Series features.
\item Hidden layers: Temporal dependencies.
\item Output layer: Prediction.
\end{itemize}
